This distribution is a modified fork of github.com/coder/acp-go-sdk,
maintained independently since August 2026 by Alexander Wink
(github.com/lx-wnk). It is not affiliated with or endorsed by Coder
Technologies, Inc.

Files in this distribution have been modified from the upstream project.
The changes fall into three groups:

  - Bug fixes in the code generator (cmd/generate): union discriminator
    dispatch, required-key enforcement, closed-object handling, typed
    maps from additionalProperties, and x-deserialize-default-on-error.
  - Regression tests covering those fixes.
  - Regeneration of the generated SDK code against ACP schema releases
    later than the last one upstream published.

CHANGELOG.md records the per-release detail. Where a fix is not specific
to this fork, it is offered back to the upstream project; CONTRIBUTING.md
describes that policy.

